&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff"&gt;リスク項目&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 2px solid #000000; width: 153.33333333333333333333333333px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; background-color: #2E74B5"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff"&gt;対応の方向性&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 2px solid #000000; width: 313.33333333333333333333333333px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; background-color: #2E74B5"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff"&gt;具体的な対応策（機会の創出）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 2px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 160px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; background-color: #2E74B5"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 4px; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px; color: #ffffff"&gt;・炭素価格の上昇&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 4px; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px; color: #ffffff"&gt;・GHG排出規制の強化&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 4px; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px; color: #ffffff"&gt;・再エネ/省エネ政策への移行&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 2px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 153.33333333333333333333333333px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; background-color: #BDD6EE"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 4px; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px"&gt;・脱炭素化の推進&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 2px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 313.33333333333333333333333333px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; background-color: #BDD6EE"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 4px; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px"&gt;・モーダルシフトの推進&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 4px; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px"&gt;・倉庫の大型化による拠点集約や、最適立地への配置を通じた物流効率化の推進&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 4px; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px"&gt;・再生可能エネルギーの導入&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 4px; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px"&gt;・創電設備の設置&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 160px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; background-color: #2E74B5"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 4px; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px; color: #ffffff"&gt;・再エネ/省エネ/次世代技術の普及&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 313.33333333333333333333333333px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; background-color: #DEEAF6"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 4px; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;; font-size: 10px"&gt;・施設運営の省エネ化（太陽光パネル、BEMS、LED等省エネ機器の導入）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 4px; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -10px"&gt;
